{"product":"LOCK Pulse","timezone":"America/New_York","generatedAt":"2026-10-21T16:20:41.000Z","status":"live","completedAt":"2026-10-21T16:20:41.000Z","nextAtLabel":"1:20 PM ET","inWindow":true,"itemCount":12,"items":[{"id":"hall-quad-dnp-wed-20261021","at":"2026-10-21T16:13:32Z","expertId":"rich-cimini","expert":"Rich Cimini","handle":"RichCimini","outlet":"ESPN Jets beat","text":"RB Breece Hall (quad) won't practice today, but he will be evaluated as the week goes on, per Glenn. So it sounds like there's a chance.","playerIds":["breece-hall","braelon-allen"],"players":["Breece Hall","Braelon Allen"],"url":"https://x.com/RichCimini/status/2112940358946419116","kind":"PRACTICE_PARTICIPATION","eventId":"nyj-hall-quad-week7","signal":"DNP_WED","priorStatus":"Questionable (quad) on Yahoo","newStatus":"DNP_WED_QUAD_EVALUATED_DAILY","why":"Head coach Aaron Glenn said Hall will not practice Wednesday and will be evaluated as the week goes on; he did not rule Hall out for Sunday vs. Miami.","implication":"Hall's Week 7 availability is uncertain. If he can't go, Braelon Allen is the next Jets back in line for early-down work.","opportunity":"Thursday and Friday practice participation and the Friday injury designation decide Hall's status; Allen's role grows only if Hall sits.","corroboration":["https://x.com/UnderdogNFL/status/2112940154046583255","https://x.com/jetsbr12/status/2112941373410410825"],"supportingSources":["underdog-nfl"],"priority":"MEDIUM","sourceType":"BEAT","team":"NYJ","relevance":"JD_ROSTER"},{"id":"cle-judkins-sampson-optimistic-w7-20261021","at":"2026-10-21T16:10:00Z","expertId":"mary-kay-cabot","expert":"Mary Kay Cabot","handle":"MaryKayCabot","outlet":"Cleveland.com Browns beat","text":"#Browns Todd Monken is optimistic that both Quinshon Judkins and Dylan Sampson will face the #Titans on Sunday.","playerIds":["dylan-sampson","quinshon-judkins"],"players":["Dylan Sampson","Quinshon Judkins"],"url":"https://x.com/MaryKayCabot/status/2112939467690447291","kind":"COACH_COMMENT","eventId":"cle-rb-returns-week7","signal":"RETURN_OPTIMISM","priorStatus":"Sampson IR stash, return timing TBD; Judkins nearing return (radio, Tue)","newStatus":"COACH_OPTIMISTIC_BOTH_PLAY_W7","why":"Head coach Todd Monken said Wednesday he is optimistic both Browns backs play Sunday vs. Tennessee. This upgrades Tuesday's radio-only expectation, which was held below floor.","implication":"Both could be back for Week 7, which would split the Browns backfield between them. Neither is officially cleared yet; practice reports will show it.","opportunity":"Watch Wednesday-Friday practice participation and any IR activation move for Sampson before Sunday.","corroboration":[],"supportingSources":[],"priority":"MEDIUM","sourceType":"BEAT","team":"CLE","relevance":"JD_ROSTER"},{"id":"nyg-mccarthy-start-w7-20261021","at":"2026-10-21T16:03:58Z","expertId":"jeremy-fowler","expert":"Jeremy Fowler","handle":"JFowlerESPN","outlet":"ESPN","text":"Source: The Giants plan to start J.J. McCarthy on Sunday vs. Houston.","playerIds":["jj-mccarthy","jameis-winston"],"players":["J.J. McCarthy","Jameis Winston"],"url":"https://x.com/JFowlerESPN/status/2112937949654606260","kind":"DEPTH_CHART","eventId":"nyg-qb-start-w7","signal":"STARTER_CHANGE","priorStatus":"Winston vs. McCarthy Week 7 decision pending","newStatus":"MCCARTHY_PLANNED_STARTER_W7","why":"ESPN's Jeremy Fowler reports, citing a source, that the Giants plan to start McCarthy over Winston Sunday vs. Houston. No official team announcement yet.","implication":"Backup QB promoted to the starting job, which shifts the Giants passing game outlook to McCarthy for Week 7.","opportunity":"QB role change on a team-wide basis; confirm with the Giants' official announcement or head coach comments.","corroboration":[],"supportingSources":[],"priority":"MEDIUM","sourceType":"NATIONAL","team":"NYG","relevance":"DISCOVERY"},{"id":"tyson-no-practice-this-week-vele-role-20261021","at":"2026-10-21T13:21:37Z","expertId"